- F125, commit `a3f30a759`: three new cases in `components/__tests__/class-session-control.test.tsx`, all with a fixed clock:
  - "posts until_17 before 17:00 Bangkok" (clock 09:00Z = 16:00 Bangkok; body equals `{ classroomId, lifetime: "until_17" }`).
  - "falls back to 3 hours when the clock passes 17:00 with until_17 selected" (clock 09:59:59Z, select `until_17`, `vi.setSystemTime` to 10:00:00Z, rerender: `3h` is checked, the `until_17` radio is gone, Start posts `3h`).
